<%--
Textbox_Click_To_Copy - Read-only text input with click-to-copy functionality

A read-only text input field with an integrated copy button. When the user clicks
anywhere in the input or on the copy icon, the value is copied to the clipboard
and visual feedback is provided.

Arguments:
- $value (string, required): The text value to display and copy

Features:
- Click anywhere in input to copy
- Copy icon button with visual feedback
- Success checkmark animation on copy
- Bootstrap input group styling

Usage:
    <Textbox_Click_To_Copy $value="https://example.com/invite?code=abc123" />

JavaScript Responsibilities:
- Handle click-to-copy for both input and button
- Clipboard API integration
- Visual feedback (icon swap to checkmark)
--%>
<Define:Textbox_Click_To_Copy tag="div" class="input-group" data-tooltip="Click to copy to clipboard">
    <input
        $sid="input"
        type="text"
        class="form-control"
        value="<%= this.args.value %>"
        readonly
        style="cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 0.2s;"
    />
    <button
        $sid="copy_btn"
        class="btn btn-outline-secondary"
        type="button"
        style="min-width: 60px;"
    >
        <i $sid="icon" class="bi bi-clipboard"></i>
    </button>
</Define:Textbox_Click_To_Copy>
